@b <http://example.org/lrml-mapping#>
@p lrmlmm=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#>
@p voc=<http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/vocab#>
@p ins=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/instrument#>
@p elg=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/eligibility#>
@p pty=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/party#>
@p bhv=<https://www.nebularis.org/neuro-semantic/lattice/behaviour#>
@o <http://example.org/lrml-mapping>
%R Scheme_LRML fm mork:RDF sh:declare [sh:PrefixDeclaration sh:prefix "lrmlmm" sh:namespace "http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#"^xsd:anyURI]
lrmlmm:PrescriptiveStatement RE
lrmlmm:Obligation RE
lrmlmm:Prohibition RE
lrmlmm:Permission RE
lrmlmm:Right RE
lrmlmm:Role RE
lrmlmm:Agent RE
lrmlmm:Reparation RE
lrmlmm:PenaltyStatement RE
lrmlmm:Violation RE
lrmlmm:Compliance RE
lrmlmm:TemporalCharacteristic RE
%X
C_Statement C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:PrescriptiveStatement
C_Obligation C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Obligation
C_Prohibition C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Prohibition
C_Permission C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Permission
C_Right C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Right
C_Role C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Role
C_Reparation C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Reparation
C_Penalty C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:PenaltyStatement
C_Violation C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Violation
C_ObBearer C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:Bearer
C_ProBearer C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:Bearer
C_PerBearer C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:Bearer
C_ObAux C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
C_PerAux C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:AuxiliaryParty
C_Filler C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:filledBy
C_Compliance C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:Compliance
C_Temporal C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML ra lrmlmm:TemporalCharacteristic
C_AppliesPenalty C cs MS rs Scheme_LRML p lrmlmm:appliesPenalty
%M MS sh:declare [sh:PrefixDeclaration sh:prefix "lrmlmm" sh:namespace "http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/ns/v1.0/metamodel#"^xsd:anyURI]
Map_Statement M+MD f C_Statement xt ins:Term w 60 n "A prescriptive statement is a provision the parties are bound by."
Map_Obligation M+MD f C_Obligation xt ins:Obligation w 90 n "Same meaning."
Map_Prohibition M+MD f C_Prohibition xt ins:Prohibition w 90 n "Same meaning."
Map_Permission M+MD f C_Permission xt ins:Permission w 85 n "Same meaning."
Map_Right M+MD f C_Right xt ins:Permission w 50 n "A right is a permission with obligations on others, only the permission half is mapped."
Map_Role M+MD f C_Role xt pty:RoleOccupancy w 55 n "A LegalRuleML role filled by an actor is an occupancy."
Map_ObBearer M+MD cb Map_Obligation xi ins:obligor f C_ObBearer xt pty:RoleOccupancy w 85
Map_ProBearer M+MD cb Map_Prohibition xi ins:obligor f C_ProBearer xt pty:RoleOccupancy w 85
Map_PerBearer M+MD cb Map_Permission xi ins:holder f C_PerBearer xt pty:RoleOccupancy w 85
Map_ObAux M+MD cb Map_Obligation xi ins:obligee f C_ObAux xt pty:RoleOccupancy w 70
Map_PerAux M+MD cb Map_Permission xi ins:counterparty f C_PerAux xt pty:RoleOccupancy w 70
Map_Filler M+MD cb Map_Role xi pty:occupiedBy f C_Filler xt pty:Actor w 65
Map_Reparation M+MD f C_Reparation xt ins:OnBreach w 55 n "A reparation links a penalty to a violated rule, which is what an OnBreach trigger is."
Map_Penalty M+MD cb Map_Reparation xr ins:arisesOn f C_Penalty xt ins:Term w 55 n "The penalty arises on breach."
Map_Violation M+MD f C_Violation xa bhv:Breached w 55 n "A violation indicates an obligation or prohibition was breached, the state a relation is in for a case."
Map_Compliance M+MD f C_Compliance xa bhv:Performed w 55 n "Compliance indicates an obligation fulfilled or a prohibition not violated."
Map_InForce M+MD f C_Temporal xt fnd:TemporalScope w 35 mork:appliesWhen [sh:NodeShape sh:property [sh:PropertyShape sh:path lrmlmm:forStatus sh:hasValue voc:InForce]] n "Only a characteristic that qualifies in-force status gives a validity period."
